  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "Given equation: 30 ÷ 9 × 2 + 70 − 14 = 17\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) ÷ and × \n\nGiven: 30 ÷ 9 × 2 + 70 − 14 = 17\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 30 × 9 ÷ 2 + 70 − 14 = ?\n\n⇒ __**30 × 9**__ ÷ 2 + 70 − 14 = ?\n\n⇒ __**270 ÷ 2**__ + 70 − 14 = ?\n\n⇒ __**135 + 70**__ − 14 = ?\n\n⇒ __**205 − 14**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 191\n\n⇒ 191 ≠ 17\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) − and +**\n\nGiven: 30 ÷ 9 × 2 + 70 − 14 = 17\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 30 ÷ 9 × 2 − 70 + 14 = ?\n\n⇒ __**30 ÷ 9**__ × 2 − 70 + 14 = ?\n\n⇒ __**(10/3) × 2**__ − 70 + 14 = ?\n\n⇒ __**(20/3) − 70**__ + 14 = ?\n\n⇒ __**(20 - 210)/3**__ + 14 = ?\n\n⇒ __**(-190/3) + 14**__ = ?\n\n⇒ (-190 + 42)/3 = -148/3\n\n⇒ -148/3 ≠ 17\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 3) ÷ and −**\n\nGiven: 30 ÷ 9 × 2 + 70 − 14 = 17\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 30 − 9 × 2 + 70 ÷ 14 = ?\n\n⇒ 30 − 9 × 2 + __**70 ÷ 14**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 30 − __**9 × 2**__ + 5 = ?\n\n⇒ __**30 − 18**__ + 5 = ?\n\n⇒ __**12 + 5**__ = ?\n\n⇒ **17**\n\n⇒ **17 = 17**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 4) + and ×\n\nGiven: 30 ÷ 9 × 2 + 70 − 14 = 17\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 30 ÷ 9 + 2 × 70 − 14 = ?\n\n⇒ __**30 ÷ 9**__ + 2 × 70 − 14 = ?\n\n⇒ (10/3) + __**2 × 70**__ − 14 = ?\n\n⇒ __**(10/3) + 140**__ − 14 = ?\n\n⇒ __**(10 + 420)/3**__ − 14 = ?\n\n⇒ __**(430/3) − 14**__ = ?\n\n⇒ (430 - 42)/3 = 388/3\n\n⇒ 388/3 ≠ 17\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
